## Quick reference

```jsx
// two outcomes
{cond ? <A /> : <B />}

// one outcome or nothing
{cond && <A />}

// safe with numbers
{list.length > 0 && <A />}

// empty state — early return
if (list.length === 0) {
  return <p>Nothing here yet.</p>;
}
```

