## Common errors

| What you see | Likely cause |
|---|---|
| A stray `0` on the page | used `&&` with a length instead of comparing |
| Both options showing | you wrote two separate `&&` lines instead of a ternary |
| Nothing appears | condition is always false — log it to check |
| Syntax error | an `if` written inside JSX braces |

